  "goodToKnow": "Der Kult has an old religious sense (worship, rite), but today it mostly means something that has a devoted following: Kultfilm, Kultserie, Kultbuch, Kultstatus. Das ist Kult! is a way of saying something is legendary. A dubious religious group, on the other hand, is not usually called a Kult but die Sekte. The adjective kultig describes something quirky and loved by fans: ein kultiges Café."
